    "body": "That would be helpful also for Trusted Types, especially with the clone operation, as the TT guards also have a state that JS APIs can affect - a list of policy names that were already created. If we could bootstrap `about:blank` (and `Blob`) documents with the used policy names already marked as such, we could address this bypass vector - at least for applications that limit policies by names.",
