    "body": "That looks great @antosart, thanks so much for working on this! One nit: when talking about blobs you want to talk specifically about creating blob URLs, as creating blobs (as in, `new Blob()`) is not impacted. There is some other state I noted in OP that could also benefit from this, such as \"cookie URL\", but it seems very reasonable to scope down and then build it out after integration. Again, very exciting!",
