    "body": "Thank you @antosart for looking into this.\r\n\r\nI just have a recommendation, which is to almost always use the navigation initiator to inherit the policy to local scheme instead of relying on parent or opener (there have been bugs due to this). There is an exception to this, which is about:srcdoc, which should always inherit policy from the parent.",
