    "created_at": "2020-12-09T17:55:17Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-12-09T17:55:17Z",
    "body": "In Chrome, cross-origin iframe can navigate to `about:srcdoc` and that would still trigger a script defined in a `srcdoc` attribute. Previously, Chrome used to inherit CSP from a navigation initiator, and this caused a [CSP bypass](https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=1001283).",
